utions. We built a high-authority digital presence that generates multi-million-dollar commercial tenders on autopilot.","keyMetrics":[{"label":"Top-3 Google Rankings","value":"35+","sub":"Target industrial & commercial keywords"},{"label":"Qualified Tender Inquiries","value":"+320%","sub":"Facility managers & property developers"},{"label":"Attributed Pipeline","value":"$$4.2M+","sub":"Commercial roofing contracts awarded"},{"label":"Lead-to-Quote Rate","value":"3.8x","sub":"Driven by interactive scoping funnel"}],"challenge":"Commercial roofing contracts range from $50,000 to over $1,000,000. Decision-makers—strata managers, corporate facility directors, and asset developers—demand stringent proof of insurance, safety certifications, and past structural case studies. The previous site looked like a residential trade site and attracted zero commercial tenders.","solution":"We completely repositioned the brand as Australia's premier commercial roofing authority. The new site highlights past mega-projects with aerial drone visuals, detailed technical specs, WorkSafe compliance accreditations, and an interactive 'Commercial Scope Calculator'. We supported this with hyper-targeted B2B organic search architecture across Sydney and NSW.","deliverables":["Enterprise B2B Corporate Website","Interactive Commercial Roof Scope Estimator","Drone Inspection & Project Portfolio Gallery","Targeted Industrial B2B Search Strategy","Instant CRM Lead Dispatch for Estimators"],"testimonial":{"quote":"Accelerance transformed how our business is perceived in the market. We transitioned from competing on price for small jobs to winning tier-1 commercial warehouse re-roofing projects. A phenomenal return on investment.","author":"Brett Henderson","role":"Managing Director, Commercial Roofers Australia"},"snapshotPreview":{"header":"Australia’s Industrial & Commercial Roofing Specialists","searchPlaceholder":"Calculate commercial roof replacement or repair costs...","highlights":["Master Builders & SafeWork NSW Certified","25-Year Manufacturer & Workmanship Warranties","$$20M Public Liability Insurance Coverage"],"featuredCategories":["Industrial Warehouse Roofing","Commercial Metal Cladding","Asbestos Safe Remediation","Preventative Asset Maintenance"]}},"mode":"card"}]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.8rem","fontWeight":700,"color":"#2563EB","textTransform":"uppercase","marginBottom":"0.4rem"},"children":"B2B Commercial & Industrial Contracting"}],["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.4rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":"0.65rem"},"children":["Commercial Roofers Australia"," — ","Commercialroofers.net.au"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.95rem","color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":1.6,"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":"Commercial Roofers Australia provides large-scale roofing, cladding, and asset rehabilitation for warehouses, shopping complexes, and educational institutions. We built a high-authority digital presence that generates multi-million-dollar commercial tenders on autopilot."}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/work/commercial-roofers/","className":"btn-black-pill","style":{"fontSize":"0.88rem","padding":"0.6rem 1.4rem"},"children":"Read Case Study →"}]]}],["$","div","designer-handle",{"className":"approach-card home-service-card","style":{"padding":"2rem"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":["$","$L5",null,{"caseStudy":{"id":"designer-handle","slug":"designer-handle","client":"Designer Handle UK","url":"https://designerhandle.co.uk","domain":"Designerhandle.co.uk","title":"Architectural Ironmongery & Hardware Platform with Real-Time Finish Filtering","subtitle":"High-spec interior hardware eCommerce with trade accounts, finish matching, and CAD specifications.","industry":"Interior Architecture & Trade eCommerce","category":"ecommerce","region":"United Kingdom","themeColor":"#27272A","accentColor":"#EAB308","heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513694203232-719a280e022f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","screenshotImage":"/images/case-studies/designerhandle-screenshot.png","iconImage":"/images/case-studies/icons/designerhandle-icon.svg","summary":"Designer Handle supplies luxury door handles, cabinet hardware, and architectural ironmongery to UK architects, interior designers, and discerning homeowners. We developed a sophisticated catalog with live finish previewing and dedicated trade client portals.","keyMetrics":[{"label":"Organic Search Revenue","value":"+210%","sub":"High-intent interior design queries"},{"label":"Repeat B2B Trade Orders","value":"+74%","sub":"Architect & contractor account portal"},{"label":"SKU Combinations","value":"55,000+","sub":"Managed with sub-second filter speed"},{"label":"Mobile Bounce Rate","value":"-38%","sub":"Fast visual gallery exploration"}],"challenge":"Architectural hardware has endless complexity: each handle comes in 6+ finishes (Satin Brass, Antique Bronze, Matte Black, Polished Chrome) and requires matching hinges, latches, and escutcheons. Customers were confused by disorganized options, and trade professionals lacked an easy way to specify whole-house schedules.","solution":"We built an intuitive, visual-first shopping experience. Users can toggle finishes across entire hardware collections simultaneously. We created a 'Project Hardware Scheduler' allowing architects to group selections by room, download PDF specifications for clients, and receive automatic trade volume discounts.","deliverables":["Custom Architectural eCommerce Platform","Dynamic Multi-Variant Finish Visualizer","Architect & Interior Designer Trade Portal","Room-by-Room Hardware Schedule Generator","Technical Product Schema & Fast UK Shipping Logic"],"testimonial":{"quote":"Specifying ironmongery used to be a headache for our architect clients. The new platform makes pairing finishes effortless. Our trade accounts have surged, and online revenue has more than doubled.","author":"James Thornton","role":"Commercial Director, Designer Handle UK"},"snapshotPreview":{"header":"Architectural Door Handles & Luxury Interior Ironmongery","searchPlaceholder":"Search by Finish (Satin Brass, Matte Black, Antique Bronze)...","highlights":["Solid Brass & Marine Grade 316 Stainless Steel","Trade Discount Accounts for Architects & Builders","Next-Day Dispatch Across the UK"],"featuredCategories":["Interior Door Handles","Cabinet Knobs & Pulls","Matching Locks & Hinges","Architectural Window Fittings"]}},"mode":"card"}]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.8rem","fontWeight":700,"color":"#2563EB","textTransform":"uppercase","marginBottom":"0.4rem"},"children":"Interior Architecture & Trade eCommerce"}],["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.4rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":"0.65rem"},"children":["Designer Handle UK"," — ","Designerhandle.co.uk"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.95rem","color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":1.6,"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":"Designer Handle supplies luxury door handles, cabinet hardware, and architectural ironmongery to UK architects, interior designers, and discerning homeowners. We developed a sophisticated catalog with live finish previewing and dedicated trade client portals."}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/work/designer-handle/","className":"btn-black-pill","style":{"fontSize":"0.88rem","padding":"0.6rem 1.4rem"},"children":"Read Case Study →"}]]}],["$","div","sofinfra",{"className":"approach-card home-service-card","style":{"padding":"2rem"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":["$","$L5",null,{"caseStudy":{"id":"sofinfra","slug":"sofinfra","client":"Sofinfra Realty Advisory","url":"https://sofinfra.com","domain":"Sofinfra.com","title":"Luxury Real Estate & Commercial Advisory Portal Capturing High-Net-Worth Investors","subtitle":"High-ticket property acquisition platform with yield calculators and confidential listing showcases.","industry":"Luxury Real Estate & Advisory","category":"reale