 of sophistication. Accelerance delivered a digital presence that sets us apart from ordinary brokers. It establishes credibility before our advisors even step into a meeting.","author":"Abhishek S.","role":"Partner & Head of Private Wealth, Sofinfra"},"snapshotPreview":{"header":"Curated Luxury Estates & Commercial Portfolios in Delhi NCR","searchPlaceholder":"Explore Prime Locations: Golf Course Ext Road, Cyber City, Diplomatic Enclave...","highlights":["Verified Institutional & Luxury Assets Only","Comprehensive Due Diligence & Yield Analysis","Discreet Private Advisory for Family Offices"],"featuredCategories":["Luxury Penthouses & Villas","Grade-A Commercial Floors","Pre-Leased High-Yield Assets","Bespoke Land Parcels"]}},"mode":"card"}]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.8rem","fontWeight":700,"color":"#2563EB","textTransform":"uppercase","marginBottom":"0.4rem"},"children":"Luxury Real Estate & Advisory"}],["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.4rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":"0.65rem"},"children":["Sofinfra Realty Advisory"," — ","Sofinfra.com"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.95rem","color":"var(--text-secondary)","lineHeight":1.6,"marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":"Sofinfra is an elite real estate advisory firm serving High-Net-Worth Individuals (HNWIs) and corporate investors seeking prime residential and commercial assets across Delhi NCR (Golf Course Road, Cyber City, Southern Peripheral). We designed a private-client advisory portal that exudes exclusivity and builds immediate trust."}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/work/sofinfra/","className":"btn-black-pill","style":{"fontSize":"0.88rem","padding":"0.6rem 1.4rem"},"children":"Read Case Study →"}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"faq-compact-section","style":{"background":"var(--bg-secondary)","borderTop":"1px solid var(--border-light)"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"style":{"textAlign":"center","maxWidth":700,"margin":"